<HEAD>PART 102&#x2014;RULES AND REGULATIONS, SERIES 8
</HEAD>
<AUTH>
<HED>Authority:</HED><PSPACE>29 U.S.C. 151, 156. Section 102.117 also issued under 5 U.S.C. 552(a)(4)(A), and &#xA7; 102.119 also issued under 5 U.S.C. 552a(j) and (k). Sections 102.143 through 102.155 also issued under 5 U.S.C. 504(c)(1).
</PSPACE></AUTH>
